Name: absl_status_macros
Description: Abseil status_macros library
URL: https://abseil.io/
Version: head
Requires: absl_core_headers = head, absl_source_location = head, absl_status = head, absl_status_builder = head, absl_statusor = head
Libs: -L${libdir}  
Cflags: -I${includedir} /W3 /bigobj /wd4005 /wd4068 /wd4180 /wd4503 /wd4800 /DNOMINMAX /DWIN32_LEAN_AND_MEAN /D_CRT_SECURE_NO_WARNINGS /D_SCL_SECURE_NO_WARNINGS /D_ENABLE_EXTENDED_ALIGNED_STORAGE
